Fixes #60396
Fixes #57026
Fixes #60413
Fixes #56736
Fixes #51940

- **Event-driven reads (`packages/client/src/solid/data.ts`):** Evicts local session state and suppresses `onError` when background refreshes (`session.created`, `session.renamed`, `session.viewed`, `session.execution.*`, `server.connected`) hit `404 SessionNotFoundError` or `MessageNotFoundError`, stopping recurring `"Request failed — Session not found"` toasts when external clients or plugins create and delete ephemeral sessions. Explicit `await data.session.sync(id)` calls still reject so open session routes render their not-found state.
- **Deletion ordering (`packages/client/src/solid/data.ts`):** Tracks a bounded per-session deletion epoch so delayed `200` metadata, family, inbox, message, permission, or form responses started before `session.deleted` cannot resurrect deleted sessions in client memory.
- **Browser pane attachment (`packages/gui-plugins/src/browser/pane.ts`, `connection.ts`, `model.ts`):** Reports `browser.pane.missing` and clears saved tab restore state when `client.session.get({ sessionID })` returns `SessionNotFoundError`, stopping the unbounded `+1s/+2s/+4s/+8s/+16s/+30s` retry loop while still waking if `session.created` arrives later.
- **Desktop cleanup (`packages/app/src/runtime/server/data.ts`, `tab-strip.tsx`, `notification.tsx`):** Treats `SessionNotFoundError` on `DELETE /api/session/:id` as idempotently deleted, skips inactive-tab prefetches for known-missing sessions, and stops `session.view` retry loops when a root session is gone.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Ext as External Client / Plugin
  participant Srv as OpenCode Server
  participant App as Desktop (createData + BrowserPane)
  Ext->>Srv: POST /api/session (id) -> 200
  Srv-->>App: SSE session.created(id)
  Ext->>Srv: DELETE /api/session/:id -> 204
  App->>Srv: GET /api/session/:id
  Srv-->>App: 404 SessionNotFoundError
  Note over App: markDeleted(id) + stop BrowserPane backoff (0 toasts)
```

```ts
if (isSessionNotFoundError(error)) {
