- **Resolve `/builtin/*` skill paths from inline `skill.content` (`packages/app/src/workspaces/files/model.tsx`):** Built-in skills (`OpenCode`, `Report`, `Browser`) register virtual `/builtin/<id>.md` paths whose Markdown body is already returned inline by `GET /api/skill`. Short-circuit `load` and `exists` on `/builtin/` paths to read from `data.location.skill` (syncing on cold tab restore) instead of splitting `/builtin` into `GET /api/fs/read?location[directory]=/builtin/` or `GET /api/fs/list`.
- **Cover built-in skill tabs in the Session details keeper (`packages/app/e2e/regression/session-summary.spec.ts`):** Verify clicking `OpenCode` under `Session details → Skills` opens `opencode.md` with its inline Markdown heading and issues zero `/api/fs/read/opencode.md` requests when `/builtin` returns 404.

