**Limits and remaining decision:** this is actual source-mode Control UI with a synthetic fixture Gateway transport. It proves frontend native-modal/Canvas/payload admission and normal serializer behavior, not a live Gateway/provider, external delivery, installed release, native macOS or Safari qualification. Linux WebKit uses an isolated persistent profile for IndexedDB Blob storage; its unchanged viewport-tag diagnostic is retained. Browser contexts, profiles and owned source servers close after each collector. Built-in composer placement still needs Control UI owner acceptance; this technical refresh does not imply approval.

The collector's obsolete `chat.startup` RPC wait was removed for current main's subscription startup path. The repository-native `page.goto` roster readiness and visible composer entry remain, along with every actual pixel, no-send, cancellation and focus assertion. First failed setup attempts remain retained, not relabeled as product results.

